  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.1": "Anuvijjakena codako pucchitabbo: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.2": "yaṃ kho tvaṃ āvuso imaṃ bhikkhuṃ codesi kimhi naṃ codesi sīlavipattiyā codesi ācāravipattiyā codesi diṭṭhivipattiyā codesīti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.3": "so ce evaṃ vadeyya: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.4": "sīlavipattiyā vā codemi, ācāravipattiyā vā codemi, diṭṭhivipattiyā vā codemīti, so evam assa vacanīyo: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.5": "jānāti panāyasmā sīlavipattiṃ . . . (Mahāvagga ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.6": "IV.16.11-15. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.7": "Instead of ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.8": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.9": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.10": "imassa ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.11": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.12": "bhikkhuno pavāraṇaṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.13": "ṭhapesi ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.14": "read ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.15": "imaṃ bhikkhuṃ codesi; instead of ṭhapemi, ṭhapesi, or pavāraṇaṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.16": "ṭhapemi etc., ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.17": "read codemi, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.18": "codesi.) . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.19": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.20": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.21": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.22": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.23": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.24": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.25": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.26": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.27": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.28": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.29": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.30": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.31": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.32": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.33": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.34": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.35": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.36": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:1.37": "titthiyasāvakānaṃ sutvā parisaṅkasīti. ||1|| ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:2.1": "diṭṭhaṃ diṭṭhena sameti, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:2.2": "diṭṭhena saṃsandate diṭṭhaṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:2.3": "diṭṭhaṃ paṭicca na upeti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:2.4": "asuddhaparisaṅkito: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:2.5": "so puggalo paṭiññāya ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:2.6": "kātabbo ten' uposatho. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:3.1": "sutaṃ sutena sameti, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:3.2": "sutena saṃsandate sutaṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:3.3": "sutaṃ paṭicca . . . uposatho. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:3.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:3.5": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:3.6": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:4.1": "mutaṃ mutena sameti, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:4.2": "mutena saṃsandate mutaṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:4.3": "mutaṃ paṭicca . . . uposatho. ||2|| ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:4.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:4.5": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:4.6": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.1": "codanāya ko ādi kiṃ majjhe kiṃ pariyosānaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.2": "codanāya okāsakammaṃ ādi kiriyā majjhe samatho pariyosānaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.3": "codanāya kati mūlāni kati vatthūni kati bhūmiyo katīh' ākārehi codeti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.4": "codanāya dve mūlāni tīṇi vatthūni pañca bhūmiyo dvīh' ākārehi codeti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.5": "codanāya katamāni dve mūlāni. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.6": "samūlikā vā amūlikā vā. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.7": "codanāya imāni dve mūlāni. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.8": "codanāya katamāni tīṇi vatthūni. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.9": "diṭṭhena sutena parisaṅkāya. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.10": "codanāya imāni tīṇi vatthūni. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.11": "codanāya katamā pañca bhūmiyo. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.12": "kālena vakkhāmi no akālena, bhūtena vakkhāmi no abhūtena, saṇhena v. no pharusena, atthasaṃhitena v. no anatthasaṃhitena, mettacitto v. no dosantaro 'ti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:5.13": "codanāya imā pañca bhūmiyo. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:6.1": "katamehi dvīh' ākārehi codeti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:6.2": "kāyena vā codeti vācāya vā codeti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:6.3": "imehi dvīh' ākārehi codeti. ||3|| ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.0": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.1": "codakena kathaṃ paṭipajjitabbaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.2": "cuditakena . . . saṃghena . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.4": "anuvijjakena kathaṃ paṭipajjitabbaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.5": "codakena kathaṃ paṭipajjitabban ti, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.6": "codakena pañcasu dhammesu patiṭṭhāya paro codetabbo: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.7": "kālena vakkhāmi no akālena . . . mettacitto vakkhāmi no dosantaro 'ti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.8": "codakena evaṃ paṭipajjitabbaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.9": "cuditakena kathaṃ paṭipajjitabban ti, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.10": "cuditakena dvīsu dhammesu paṭipajjitabbaṃ ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.11": "sacce ca akuppe ca. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.12": "cuditakena evaṃ paṭipajjitabbaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.13": "saṃghena kathaṃ paṭipajjitabban ti, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.14": "saṃghena otiṇṇānotiṇṇaṃ jānitabbaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.15": "saṃghena evaṃ paṭipajjitabban ti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.16": "anuvijjakena kathaṃ paṭipajjitabban ti. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.17": "anuvijjakena yena dhammena yena vinayena yena satthu sāsanena taṃ adhikaraṇaṃ vūpasammati tathā taṃ adhikaraṇaṃ vūpasametabbaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:7.18": "anuvijjakena evaṃ paṭipajjitabbaṃ. ||4|| ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:8.1": "uposatho kimatthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:8.2": "pavāraṇā kissa kāraṇā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:8.3": "parivāso kimatthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:8.4": "mūlāya paṭikassanā kissa kāraṇā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:8.5": "mānattaṃ kimatthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:8.6": "abbhānaṃ kissa kāraṇā. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:9.1": "uposatho sāmaggatthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:9.2": "visuddhatthāya pavāraṇā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:9.3": "parivāso mānattatthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:9.4": "mūlāya paṭikassanā niggah- atthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:9.5": "mānattaṃ abbhānatthāya, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:9.6": "visuddhatthāya abbhānaṃ. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:10.1": "chandā dosā bhayā mohā ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:10.2": "there ca paribhāsati: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:10.3": "kāyassa bhedā duppañño ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:10.4": "khato upahatindriyo ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:10.5": "nirayaṃ gacchati dummedho ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:10.6": "na ca sikkhāya gāravo. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:11.1": "na ca āmisaṃ nissāya ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:11.2": "na ca nissāya puggalaṃ, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:11.3": "ubho ete vivajjetvā ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:11.4": "yathādhammo tathā kare. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:12.0": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:12.1": "kodhano upanāhī ca ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:12.2": "caṇḍo ca paribhāsako 5 ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:12.3": "anāpattiyā āpattīti ropeti: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:12.4": "tādiso codako jhāpeti attānaṃ. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:13.1": "upakaṇṇakaṃ jappati jimhaṃ pekkhati ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:13.2": "vītiharati kum- maggaṃ paṭisevati ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:13.3": "anāpattiyā āpattīti ropeti: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:13.4": "tādiso codako jhāpeti attānaṃ | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:14.1": "akālena codeti abhūtena ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:14.2": "pharusena anatthasaṃhitena, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:14.3": "dosantaro codeti no mettacitto, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:14.4": "anāpattiyā . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:14.5": "jhāpeti attānaṃ. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:15.1": "dhammādhammaṃ na jānāti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:15.2": "dhammādhammassa akovido, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:15.3": "anāpattiyā . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:15.4": "jhāpeti attānaṃ. | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:16.1": "vinayāvinayaṃ na jānāti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:16.2": "vinayāvinayassa akovido, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:16.3": "anāpattiyā . . . ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:16.4": "jhāpeti attānaṃ. | 10 ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:17.1": "bhāsitābhāsitaṃ . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:17.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:17.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:17.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:18.1": "āciṇṇānāciṇṇaṃ . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:18.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:18.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:18.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:19.1": "paññattāpaññattaṃ . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:19.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:19.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:19.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:20.1": "āpattānāpattiṃ na jānāti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:20.2": "āpattānāpattiyā akovido . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:20.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:20.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:21.1": "lahukagarukaṃ . . . | 15 ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:21.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:21.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:21.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:22.1": "sāvasesānavasesaṃ . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:22.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:22.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:22.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:23.1": "duṭṭhullāduṭṭhullaṃ . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:23.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:23.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:23.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:24.1": "pubbāparaṃ . . . | ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:24.2": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:24.3": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:24.4": "",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:25.1": "anusandhivacanapathaṃ na jānāti ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:25.2": "anusandhivacanapa- thassa akovido, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:25.3": "anāpattiyā āpattīti ropeti: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:25.4": "tādiso codako jhāpeti attānan ti. |5| ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:26.1": "Codanākaṇḍaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:27.1": "tass' uddānaṃ: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:28.1": "codanā, anuvijjā cā, ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:28.2": "ādi, mūlen', uposatho: ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:28.3": "gati codanakaṇḍamhi ",
  "pli-tv-pvr13:28.4": "sāsanaṃ patiṭṭhāpayan ti. Saṃgāmāvacarena "
}
